  "title": "Excelerate Energy Announces Quarterly Dividend Increase",
  "summary": "THE WOODLANDS, TX, July 30, 2026 – Excelerate Energy, Inc. (the “Company” or “Excelerate”) (NYSE: EE) announced today that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend, with respect to the quarter ended June 30, 2026, of $0.09 per share of Class A common stock, representing an approximately 13% increase from the prior quarter. The dividend is payable […]",
